\]

where:
- \( L_m \) is the flignability limit of the mixture mixture (e.g., flacity ratio)
- \( L_1 \) is the flignability limit of the first component (e.g., flacity ratio)
- \( L_2 \) is the flignability range of the second component (e.g., flacity range)

