\[ 25b^2 - 80a > 0 \]
\[ 25b^2 > 80a \]
\[ b^2 > \frac{80a}{25} \]
\[ b^2 > \frac{16a}{5} \]

The solutions are:
\[ x = \frac{-5b + \sqrt{25b^2 - 80a}}{2a}, \quad x = \frac{-5b - \sqrt{25b^2 - 80a}}{2a} \]

