\[
\text{Total area of string} = 10,000 \times 0.0001 \, \text{m}^2 = 1 \, \text{m}^2
\]

The drag coefficient for a flat plate is \( 0.5 \), so the drag force for the string is:

\[
F_{\text{string}} = \frac{1}{2} \rho v^2 A C_D = \frac{1}{2} \times 1.025 \times 3^2 \times 1 \times 0.5 = 1.5375 \, \text{N}
\]

Thus, the drag force for 1 m² of the net is \( \boxed{1.5375 \, \text{N}} \).

